{"id":"8438c6ecfb48c83f","group":"93","path":"93/93-ax-filter-zorn.md","title":"Filter Zorn","display":"ax-filter-zorn — Filter Zorn","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ax-filter-zorn","aliases":["93-ax-filter-zorn"],"display":"ax-filter-zorn — Filter Zorn","depends_on":["[[93-df-filter]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ax-filter-zorn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ax-filter-zorn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-filter-zorn — Filter Zorn"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, with carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf A|\">\\(|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}\\)</span> is the proper Boolean-algebra-filter predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\\)</span> (the Boolean-algebra ultrafilter predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}filter\\text{-}zorn}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\exists U\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(F\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}filter\\text{-}zorn}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\exists U\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(F\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The Filter Zorn axiom, based on Zorn's Lemma, guarantees that every proper filter in a Boolean algebra can be extended to an ultrafilter (a maximal proper filter). This is fundamental for establishing the semantic completeness of propositional logic via maximal consistent theories and their corresponding ultrafilters.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}$ is the proper Boolean-algebra-filter predicate of [[93-df-ultrafilter]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ (the Boolean-algebra ultrafilter predicate of [[93-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}filter\\text{-}zorn}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{ProperFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\n\\to\\exists U\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(F\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(U,\\mathbf A)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1150,"backlinks":[{"id":"d2607dfa48c40f32","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9beeac4373d773f8","7087f500cc845c3b","fc989d8f8938c283"]}